00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:24.480
Act Three

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:27.070
Act Three

00:01:23.980 --> 00:01:27.070
Act Three

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.370
Wow... it's so pretty.

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.460
Say...

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:31.510
Why don't we go to an unknown village...

00:02:31.630 --> 00:02:33.470
and live together?

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.470
You would lose your immortality,

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:42.270
once you decide to stay
in the human realm.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.270
I am aware of that.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.350
But...

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:51.480
I am confident that I can give you
something more than eternal life.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:55.660
We may have forty years left.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:58.620
No, it could be thirty
or even twenty years.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:04.080
Compared to the life of a forgotten god,
a human life is merely a moment.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:08.960
But there is no difference in the beauty
of a flower that dies in a day...

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:13.630
...and a flower that blossoms
for a hundred years.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:21.180
Tomihime, let us live and die together.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:34.530
Twenty years...

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:40.240
Will we be able to eat that dango
again in such a limited time?

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.540
Of course, will you consider it?

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:53.210
Hime-sama.

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:01.180
Why are you here?

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:06.060
Please return to our castle.

00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:27.710
I will change my kimono
and return immediately.

00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:29.040
All right.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:50.560
I ask that you visit your maids' chamber.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.140
The wound has not healed.

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:28.930
She bled too much. The wound has
become inflamed and swollen.

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:33.020
We are losing our immortal powers.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:36.820
You know exactly why.

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:44.160
It is because you, hime-sama,
are infatuated with that human!

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:53.790
Forgive me, Susuki.

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:58.880
It's okay.

00:05:59.590 --> 00:06:01.550
It is okay, hime-sama.

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:08.850
Hime, are you willing to make the same
mistake as your mother?

00:06:08.970 --> 00:06:13.810
Do you plan to take us all with
you to the underworld?

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:38.210
Susuki has passed away.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:56.480
There you are.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:07:00.320
When you didn't come back, I decided
to come looking for you.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:03.990
If Uba finds me here,
she'll try to get rid of me again.

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:14.830
What is the matter?

00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:19.840
Tomihime?

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:26.010
Step back...

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:30.430
I am ordering you to step back!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:39.110
You must leave this castle.

00:07:41.190 --> 00:07:44.360
You must get out of my sight now!

00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:47.360
Tomihime...

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.080
I want to live.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:57.370
If you take one step towards me,
my wound becomes larger.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:02.460
When caressed by your breath,
the bleeding will not stop.

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.050
But...

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:11.140
Are you telling me to die?

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:14.310
No.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:18.850
You're a human...

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.310
after all.

00:08:20.810 --> 00:08:22.480
And I am a forgotten god.

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:27.070
We were never meant to associate
with one another in this life.

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.370
Our encounter was a mistake.

00:08:37.290 --> 00:08:38.250
Go now.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:42.960
If you ever show yourself
in front of me again,

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:45.670
I will kill you.

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:55.640
Tomihime!

00:08:59.440 --> 00:09:00.690
I do not believe...

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:04.770
that our meeting was a mistake.

00:09:09.030 --> 00:09:10.320
I don't believe...

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.490
we belong to different realms.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:19.830
I would have liked to quench
your thirst again.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:23.920
Even though we may be separated
from each other,

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:28.630
I still hope for a single
flower to bloom in your heart.

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:35.810
May your life be blessed with happiness.

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:41.730
I wish the same for you.

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.700
This is for the best...

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:20.720
Zushonosuke-san...

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.060
Oshizu...

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.650
Zushonosuke-san.

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:34.570
You have finally returned.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.660
Yes.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.320
I'm so glad.

00:10:41.330 --> 00:10:42.580
I apologize...

00:10:44.330 --> 00:10:45.420
Do not cry.

00:11:58.910 --> 00:11:59.820
Kojiro

00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.290
Hold on a moment.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:47.370
I'm home!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.330
Welcome home.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:53.540
Oh, thrushes.

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:01.470
What's wrong?

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:03.550
It's nothing.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.790
Rejected by the Shogun at the front gate.

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.790
Was it because of the missing falcon?

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:34.130
Unlikely, that's just our Lord's excuse.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:35.880
Don't be so loud!

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.630
He's not listening
to our conversation anyways.

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:40.300
A moment please!

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:45.640
I've brought some important
information for the Lord!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.270
Hey, hey! Get out of here.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:50.270
You're the falconer's...

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:55.980
I've allowed your husband to return
to being a falconer out of leniency.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:57.860
You shouldn't have any business.

00:13:58.110 --> 00:14:00.780
It is in regards to the falcon, Kojiro.

00:14:01.240 --> 00:14:02.200
I am listening.

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.200
Lord!

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:06.200
The falcon remains in Castle Shirasagi.

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:11.620
An evil spirit disguised as a woman
is hiding the falcon in her castle.

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:12.920
What are you saying?

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:14.080
Begone!

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.790
An evil spirit? I get it now.

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:19.460
She must be planning to take my life.

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:22.930
Lord!

00:14:23.090 --> 00:14:24.720
It is unlikely...

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.140
Kill her!

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:31.730
Get me the head of the evil spirit!

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:47.200
Seize Castle Shirasagi!

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.960
Hurry! Hurry! Tell everyone of the news!

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:56.380
They're about to seize that castle
infested with demons.

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.340
Hey, what's going on?

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.970
Hey... Hey!

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:17.060
What are you up to?

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:20.360
I've come to gather some information.

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:21.940
Of what?

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:26.950
The Harima forces are planning
to assault Castle Shirasagi.

00:15:27.160 --> 00:15:30.200
I think we should also pay
the castle a visit.

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:33.700
Once the battle starts, the castle
will become vulnerable,

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:37.330
and that will be our chance
to sneak in and take the treasure!

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:39.710
It's no use.

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:44.210
The humans don't stand a chance
against the forgotten gods.

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.720
You're wrong. Castle Shirasagi will fall.

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:53.310
Thanks to a certain someone, the girls in
the castle have become very weak.

00:15:53.770 --> 00:15:55.890
They are no longer immortal.

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:59.940
The humans are sure to die, but most
likely the forgotten gods will as well.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:21.000
I want to make flowers bloom
for your sake.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.410
Tell the ministries Zushonosuke has died.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:02.040
You should be able to receive
some money from the state.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:06.090
Oshizu, you must also believe
that I am dead.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:07.380
Forgive me.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:32.820
Aguri!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:34.030
What is wrong?

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:52.800
Why... Why are you here?

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:57.390
I've told you before...

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:59.180
The next time you come...

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:01.850
Yes, I've come to be killed.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:07.400
No, Himekawa Zushonosuke
has already died.

00:18:07.900 --> 00:18:09.650
What are you saying?

00:18:10.190 --> 00:18:11.110
Go home!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.570
I no longer have a place to return.

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:17.700
If I cannot be with you,
then I would rather you kill me.

00:19:03.910 --> 00:19:04.920
Why?

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.130
Please don't ask me why.

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:08.840
I have no answer.

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:10.800
But...

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:11.920
But?

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:14.260
It's like a restless horse.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:15.720
Restless horse?

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:19.180
Or like overflowing water.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:20.560
Overflowing...

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:22.680
It cannot be stopped.

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:27.560
Is this what you humans call love?

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:29.940
Yes.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:34.360
It's troublesome, but not bad at all.

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:54.260
Do you think we'll win or lose in this war?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:57.590
I probably agree with what you think.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:19:58.970
You are cunning.

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:01.180
Odawara-sama.

00:20:02.560 --> 00:20:05.020
This woman is saying
she would like to see you.

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:09.560
No, not you again.

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:11.860
Please, take me with you.

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.860
What are you saying?

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.320
I've been in that castle before.

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:22.370
Fine, fine. Follow me.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:24.660
Thank you very much.

00:20:34.210 --> 00:20:35.170
Tomihime-sama!

00:20:36.510 --> 00:20:37.470
What is it?

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:38.800
Please, take a look.

